+   content-visibility lets the browser skip rendering — and animating — what is not
+   near the viewport; contain-intrinsic-size keeps the scrollbar honest by
+   remembering how tall each card was the last time it rendered. Ignored by
+   browsers that do not support it, which simply get today's behaviour. */
+.product-card,
+#productGrid > .skel-block {
+    content-visibility: auto;
+    contain-intrinsic-size: auto 26rem;
+}
